# Mosquitto ACL for the door. One user per process.
# read = subscribe, write = publish. Anything not listed is refused.
# Install: see contract/README.md

user door-reader
topic read door/reader/allowlist
topic read door/reader/feedback
topic write door/reader/uid
topic write door/reader/local
topic write door/reader/log
topic write door/reader/status
topic write door/actuator/open

user door-actuator
topic read door/actuator/open
topic write door/actuator/status
topic write door/actuator/result

user door-server
topic read door/#
topic write door/#
